          "type": "text",
          "content": "એંડપૉઇંટ: https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "### getAccountInfo\n\n```bash\ncurl https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"getAccountInfo\",\"params\":[\"64AcKtFgExrtJWPJVr6U4iQrJ1VpiUvDHvRtdMHAcoin\",{\"encoding\":\"jsonParsed\"}]}'\n```"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "### getSignaturesForAddress\n\n```bash\ncurl https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"getSignaturesForAddress\",\"params\":[\"64AcKtFgExrtJWPJVr6U4iQrJ1VpiUvDHvRtdMHAcoin\",{\"limit\":10}]}'\n```"
        },
